          "age": "1989",
          "atopy": false,
          "badText": "People who do not enjoy scents (even natural scents) may not like this product. The thin viscosity may not be right for those who prefer thick cleansing oils.",
          "blind": 0,
          "brand": "조선미녀 (BeautyofJoseon)",
          "commentCount": 0,
          "encryptedProductId": "4d6dbaa05fca9a8e06f5ac8724a20a28",
          "gender": "여성",
          "goodText": "So far I have been enjoying this cleansing oil. It seems to cleanse my face well without drying my skin out. I have used it to remove sunscreen and BB cream, but not heavy makeup.\n\nIt has a light scent, which I personally enjoy. The viscosity is thin and the colour is a very pale orange. The pump style bottle is convenient to use, and I appreciate that it can be opened and closed instead of staying open. At first the pump was stiff, and did not spring back up well. I had to pull it back up myself each time I pumped it. Now that the bottle is less full, the pump is working better and springs back up smoothly more often.",
